lines = Array[String](["???: *Yawn*", "???: Quit staring, bubbles.", "???: Or I'll pop you. You look poppable.", "Prite: What? What does that even mean?", "???: It means what it means, dingus.", "Prite: Oh, okay. ", "Prite: Who even are you?", "7UP: I'm 7UP. Obviously. Can't you read the can?", "Prite: Oh, sorry. I'm Prite. It's nice to meet you.", "7UP: What kind of bum name is that? I've never heard of a drink called \"Prite.\"", "Prite: I think that's what it said on my can.", "7UP: Yeah, I don't care. Do you know the way out?", "Prite: No? But I think it's getting colder.", "7UP: Can you stop stating the obvious? I'm going to get out.", "7UP: You go do whatever idiots do."])

